      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not necessary for the initial check-in, but regarding tests: we should have a testing story for partners / carriers wanting to test/confirm that NITZ signals are still used when NTP is unavailable. Silencing NTP is a little more difficult than silencing NITZ.\n\nPerhaps:\n\nadb shell dumpsys time_detector? \nturn off wifi + cell data plan?\nsystem property to disable NTP or change the priority order?\n\nSomething new with:\n\"adb shell time_detector cmd\" to alter priority or disable NTP might also work.",
